{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/c3cbae798a90cebb0a2ef1d09279927b.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a gnome and prepare to invade the houses of unsuspecting humans along with up to 3 friends of your choice. After finding your way in, take anything you want. Human laws don't apply to gnomes! Just try to be stealthy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.poster.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.webm?t=1764248078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.mp4?t=1764248078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While burgling is a very productive activity on its own, you also need to secure passage. The High-Gnome won't transport you around for free, and he really needs <u>gnomium</u>\u00a0for his (undisclosed) purposes. Think of it as a finder's fee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/32c15602a54b81d1bf6effead7e200d2.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the stuff you find is useful as is, however a certain amount of repurposing is often needed to fit the specific needs of gnomes. Craft equipment, build functional furniture, and upgrade your home with the burglin' haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.poster.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.webm?t=1764248078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.mp4?t=1764248078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/4dfce2e429987b2c459abc5cb8171b05.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes are small and fragile, and often hunted by other beings. Interact with the environment and use your equipment to slow down any hostile meanies. Stay vigilant, and be ready to rescue one another. The High-Gnome doesn't like resurrecting unworthy gnomes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844970?t=1764248078","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/8aae66e4daff3deeb8068e4060a5b25eac4ad907/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764248078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/e41b58cdb34075d167e6905d090cd0a7f69c2254/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764248078","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/e41b58cdb34075d167e6905d090cd0a7f69c2254/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764248078","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The gnomes can get dismembered, exploded, or die in other brutal ways.\r\nThere is no sexual content, however the human might appear naked to perform daily activities like taking a bath. Sensitive areas have been censored, and nothing obscene can be seen at any point."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/c3cbae798a90cebb0a2ef1d09279927b.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a gnome and prepare to invade the houses of unsuspecting humans along with up to 3 friends of your choice. After finding your way in, take anything you want. Human laws don't apply to gnomes! Just try to be stealthy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.poster.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.webm?t=1764248078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/ef736b5018ebfb67c793aa354e477320.mp4?t=1764248078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While burgling is a very productive activity on its own, you also need to secure passage. The High-Gnome won't transport you around for free, and he really needs <u>gnomium</u>\u00a0for his (undisclosed) purposes. Think of it as a finder's fee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/32c15602a54b81d1bf6effead7e200d2.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the stuff you find is useful as is, however a certain amount of repurposing is often needed to fit the specific needs of gnomes. Craft equipment, build functional furniture, and upgrade your home with the burglin' haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.poster.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.webm?t=1764248078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/f03d40c7d926ab646aff41e6c00a8823.mp4?t=1764248078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844970/extras/4dfce2e429987b2c459abc5cb8171b05.avif?t=1764248078\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes are small and fragile, and often hunted by other beings. Interact with the environment and use your equipment to slow down any hostile meanies. Stay vigilant, and be ready to rescue one another. The High-Gnome doesn't like resurrecting unworthy gnomes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fobri"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure"