x338.jpg?t=1764248078"}],"short_description":"An online Co-op game about breaking into houses as a tiny gnome. Avoid danger, repurpose stolen household items, and collect gnomium to meet the High-Gnome\u2019s demands. Craft equipment and upgrade your home to make your missions easier and more successful.","steam_appid":3844970,"support_info":{"email":"gamesbyfobri@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}